#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:175
msgid ""
"This appears because average CO₂ per order increased above the efficiency "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur mhéadaigh meán-CO₂ in aghaidh an ordaithe os "
"cionn na tairsí éifeachtúlachta."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:203
msgid ""
"This appears because emissions increased while orders did not grow "
"significantly."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur mhéadaigh astaíochtaí agus nár tháinig méadú "
"suntasach ar orduithe."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:371
msgid ""
"This appears because one emissions driver is above the hotspot risk "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc go bhfuil tiománaí astaíochtaí amháin os cionn na "
"tairsí riosca hotspot."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:396
msgid ""
"This appears because one emissions driver is above the hotspot warning "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo le feiceáil toisc go bhfuil tiománaí astaíochtaí amháin os cionn "
"na tairsí rabhaidh hotspot."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:316
msgid "This appears because order growth was stronger than emissions growth."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc go raibh fás ordaithe níos láidre ná fás astaíochtaí."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:152
msgid ""
"This appears because order volume increased while estimated emissions "
"decreased."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur mhéadaigh an méid ordaithe agus gur tháinig "
"laghdú ar astaíochtaí measta."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:296
msgid ""
"This appears because orders decreased while estimated emissions increased."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur tháinig laghdú ar orduithe agus gur mhéadaigh "
"astaíochtaí measta."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:226
msgid ""
"This appears because shipping represents more than half of the selected "
"period’s estimated emissions."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gurb ionann loingseoireacht agus níos mó ná leath "
"d'astaíochtaí measta na tréimhse roghnaithe."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:340
msgid ""
"This appears because the emissions increase crossed the abnormal spike "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur thrasnaigh an méadú astaíochtaí an tairseach "
"spíce neamhghnácha."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:105
msgid ""
"This appears because the plugin could not compare the selected period with a "
"previous snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo le feiceáil toisc nach bhféadfadh an breiseán an tréimhse "
"roghnaithe a chur i gcomparáid le léargas roimhe seo."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:87
msgid "This appears because the selected snapshot period has zero orders."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo le feiceáil toisc go bhfuil orduithe nialasacha ag an tréimhse "
"snapshot roghnaithe."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:128
msgid "This appears because total CO₂ increased above the high-risk threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur mhéadaigh CO₂ iomlán os cionn na tairsí "
"ardriosca."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:248
msgid ""
"This appears because total estimated CO₂ decreased beyond the positive "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur tháinig laghdú ar CO₂ measta iomlán thar an "
"tairseach dhearfach."

#: includes/class-vcarb-insights.php:274
msgid ""
"This appears because total estimated CO₂ increased above the warning "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Dealraíonn sé seo toisc gur mhéadaigh an CO₂ measta iomlán os cionn na "
"tairsí rabhaidh."

