#: includes/class-vcarb-sustainability-summary.php:156
msgid ""
"This summary is generated from saved VerdantCart Carbon Reports snapshot "
"data. It uses eligible WooCommerce order records, stored emissions totals, "
"hotspot data, and deterministic local insight rules. Historical snapshots "
"are intended to keep reporting consistent over time."
msgstr ""
"Gintear an achoimre seo ó shonraí snapshot VerdantCart Carbon Reports a "
